        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: వృత్తి",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వృత్తి — vṛtti — \"a profession; a calling\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మా నాన్నగారి వృత్తి వైద్యం. mā nānnagāri vṛtti vaidyaṁ. My father's profession is medicine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Your calling: వృత్తిరీత్యా, by profession."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వృత్తి (vṛtti) is borrowed from Sanskrit vṛtti, \"mode of life, course of action\" (Monier-Williams): the way you make your living."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
